      "claim": "For apartments the legal notice period is 3 months to a locally customary date, or if none, to the end of a 3-month rental period (Art. 266c CO); business premises 6 months.",
      "verdict": "contradicted"
    },
    {
      "claim": "Notice must be in writing; a landlord must use a canton-approved form (Art. 266l).",
      "verdict": "contradicted"
